=== base ===
# Equipment Rental Agreement

This Agreement is made between Kestrel Plant Hire Ltd (the "Owner") and Brindle Groundworks Ltd (the "Hirer").

## 3. Rental
3.1 The Hirer shall pay a weekly rental of £1,250 for each excavator.
3.2 The Owner shall service each excavator every 250 operating hours.
=== amendment ===
# Deed of Variation

This Deed is made on 9 March 2027 between Kestrel Plant Hire Ltd (the "Owner") and Brindle Groundworks Ltd (the "Hirer").

1. Clause 3.1 is varied by substituting "£1,400" for "£1,250".
